# One CI gate, one file (issue #991).
ci_gate check-architecture-contents
  stage web
  description "ARCHITECTURE.md stays a table of contents: every topic file under docs/architecture/ is linked from it, every linked topic file exists, and every #anchor it links names a heading of that file."
  run "node scripts/check-architecture-contents.mjs"
  justification "PR #1188 (R1188-U2): the Small Public Documentation principle of link-foundation/code-architecture-principles keeps ARCHITECTURE.md as contents over one file per topic; without this gate a renamed heading or a new topic file silently drifts out of the contents."
